    <name>SkipperCast Avila–Point Estero habitat atlas</name>
    <desc>Dated survey-derived habitat candidates and optional fishing alignments. Source-datum depth screen &lt;=200 ft. Not for passage navigation. Derived from public-domain USGS surveys; credit USGS, CSUMB Seafloor Mapping Lab, and University of California Center for Integrated Spatial Research. Underlying source rights remain unchanged. See repository NOTICE.md for original-material terms.</desc>
